ew_level[i] = a + b\n            # If there's a mix, flipping the one that's cheapest among the majority will suffice.\n            # Because of sorting, the median 'b' correctly holds the required cost and sign.\n            else:\n                new_level[i] = b\n                \n        level = new_level\n        \n    print(abs(level[0]))\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    solve()\n</solution>",
